<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-TALLINNA H1 GROUP PROFIT 38 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-TALLINNA H1 GROUP PROFIT 38 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997 first half group results</p>
<p>				    (million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				   38   vs 19.7</p>
<p> Net interest income			53.6 vs 43.5</p>
<p> Total net income			  162.7 vs 97.6</p>
<p> Personnel costs			    45.6 vs 34.3</p>
<p> Administrative costs		     33.4 vs 25</p>
<p> Total operating costs		   104.3 vs 70.6</p>
<p>BALANCE SHEET</p>
<p> Total assets (billion kroons)	  2.65 vs 1.52</p>
<p> Deposits     (billion kroons)	  1.25 vs 1.04</p>
<p> Loans	  (billion kroons)	  1.33 vs 0.72</p>
<p> Total own capital			297.5  vs 162</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
